<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/2026-10-19T021917Z-core-ontology> a prov:Activity , dct:ProvenanceStatement ;
  rdfs:label "Core domain ontology rebuilt on BFO 2020, 2026-10-19T02:19:17Z"@en ;
  dct:description "Workbench 2.2.0. The core domain ontology was rebuilt under https://www.insperity.com/ontology/core/ from the authored source ontology-core.source.ttl with build_core.py: every class specializes a BFO 2020 class and every relation a BFO, RO or IAO relation; it is anchored on the process step. Its SHACL shapes were rebuilt under https://www.insperity.com/shapes/core/. The core-domain ontology and the five core-* shapes graphs were superseded. core:formalizedBy was added to the top concepts of the 22 core taxonomies. The RO extract (0.1.0) was created as a reference module. Changed outside the KE Workbench; recorded retrospectively on 2026-10-19T19:06:10Z."@en ;
  dct:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" ;
  dct:contributor "Claude (AI assistant), at the direction of Jeffrey Wallk" ;
